sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant GoProxy as Go Proxy
    participant LakehouseApp as Databricks App

    Note over Browser,LakehouseApp: WebSocket Connection Initiation

    Browser->>GoProxy: HTTP GET with Upgrade: websocket<br/>Connection: Upgrade
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Detect WebSocket upgrade request<br/>Check headers
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Parse URL & decrypt OAuth token
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Convert https:// to wss://
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Create Authorization header

    Note over GoProxy,LakehouseApp: Establish Upstream WebSocket

    GoProxy->>LakehouseApp: WebSocket Dial with Authorization header
    LakehouseApp->>LakehouseApp: Validate OAuth token
    LakehouseApp->>GoProxy: 101 Switching Protocols
    GoProxy->>Browser: 101 Switching Protocols

    Note over Browser,LakehouseApp: Bidirectional Message Proxying

    par Client to Server
        loop Message Flow
            Browser->>GoProxy: WebSocket message (text/binary)
            GoProxy->>LakehouseApp: Forward message
            LakehouseApp->>LakehouseApp: Process message
        end
    and Server to Client
        loop Message Flow
            LakehouseApp->>GoProxy: WebSocket message (text/binary)
            GoProxy->>Browser: Forward message
            Browser->>Browser: Process message
        end
    end

    Note over Browser,LakehouseApp: Connection Closure

    Browser->>GoProxy: Close frame
    GoProxy->>LakehouseApp: Close frame
    LakehouseApp->>GoProxy: Close acknowledgment
    GoProxy->>Browser: Close acknowledgment
